    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Counterattack Of Sacrifice&quot; is a horror adventure game that explores the game world through the use of a first-person perspective, the scene combines Western and Eastern elements, content tends to be scary, dark, weird, and exotic, player will control an ordinary man and help him escape from a strange village controlled by a cult.<br><br>Summary : It tells the story of the protagonist's parents who wanted to visit relatives who lived far away, but later lost all news due to unknown reasons, in order to find the truth, the protagonist decided to go alone...<br><br>After arriving at the destination, the protagonist discovered a strange mountain road.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979580/extras/a7008ada60cc7ba597d0ea034c08a985.avif?t=1753685533\" /></div><br>Go deeper...and come to a dead village.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979580/extras/05cd32cdde34c49f4108aae302ba0d99.avif?t=1753685533\" /></div><br>He realized that this was not the place he should be, and when he wanted to escape, it was too late.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979580/extras/683635e1bf6a4ef9fe2ef700dde139ec.avif?t=1753685533\" /></div><br>This eerie village has an unknown past that is waiting for players to experience it for themselves.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979580/extras/9f79d53ffc728c25b351c2bdf86f65ae.avif?t=1753685533\" /></div>",
